00:08:57.360 --> 00:08:59.190
Like, "Help me find an outfit."

00:08:59.190 --> 00:09:01.230
And I would love that.
- It's a gift to be able

00:09:01.230 --> 00:09:02.640
to know how to help that situation.

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:03.473
- [Gwen] But I do, I love that.

00:09:03.473 --> 00:09:05.490
And so, I just looked
up for the girls over

00:09:05.490 --> 00:09:06.323
