00:09:06.323 --> 00:09:07.740
"I wanna be one of those girls."

00:09:07.740 --> 00:09:09.780
Like, I wanna be behind the
counter. I know I can do it.

00:09:09.780 --> 00:09:12.720
And finally, they just open the door.

00:09:12.720 --> 00:09:13.590
