00:09:13.590 --> 00:09:14.880
They didn't tell me what to do.

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:18.300
They were like, "Just make
a display and sell makeup."

00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:19.770
And so, I started doing it.

00:09:19.770 --> 00:09:23.250
But the joy of it was,
when people would come in

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:25.230
and just want, like, free samples

00:09:25.230 --> 00:09:26.940
