00:09:34.950 --> 00:09:37.620
The way I feel when I wake
up and look at myself,

00:09:37.620 --> 00:09:39.570
and then after my makeup's done,

00:09:39.570 --> 00:09:40.980
like, it's just that feeling.

00:09:40.980 --> 00:09:43.740
So I feel it's like this giving feeling.

00:09:43.740 --> 00:09:45.030
So, that's kinda where it came from.

00:09:45.030 --> 00:09:47.250
