colors and stuff like that,

00:10:53.220 --> 00:10:55.710
it is challenging, like,
for it to finally be out.

00:10:55.710 --> 00:10:57.210
And then we also launched this,

00:10:57.210 --> 00:10:59.910
this is really cool if you love makeup or-

00:10:59.910 --> 00:11:01.080
